#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_1"
msgstr ""
"The game follows the rules of classic solitaire.\n"
"\n"
"You can stack cards if they are of different colors and have consecutive "
"decreasing numbers."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_2"
msgstr ""
"Numbered cards can be collected by dragging them over these slots.\n"
"You win if you collect them all!"

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_3"
msgstr ""
"Collectors will glow when a card can be collected.\n"
"Click on them to automatically collect that card or drag the correct card on "
"top of them."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_4"
msgstr ""
"There are 2 special cards: the [color=#ffe050]Priest[/color] and the "
"[color=a40000]Vampire[/color].\n"
"\n"
"When active, they both have a special effect after each of your moves."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_5"
msgstr ""
"The [color=a40000]Vampire[/color] will bite innocent villagers (black cards) "
"and turn them into vampires (red cards).\n"
"\n"
"His next target is chosen randomly and signaled by the red smoke around a "
"card."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_6"
msgstr ""
"The [color=#ffe050]Priest[/color] will heal vampires (red cards) and turn "
"them into villagers (black cards).\n"
"\n"
"His next target is chosen randomly and signaled by the holy sparkles around "
"a card."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_7"
msgstr ""
"Both special cards are only active when in their lairs.\n"
"\n"
"The [color=#ffe050]Priest[/color]'s lair is the silver tray and the "
"[color=a40000]Vampire[/color]'s lair is the coffin."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_8"
msgstr ""
"There are 3 neutral areas.\n"
"One card of any color can be placed here at a time.\n"
"\n"
"Moving a card between areas is not considered a move."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_9"
msgstr ""
"Store special cards in a neutral zone or keep them covered beneath other "
"cards to have them deactivated.\n"
"\n"
"Deactivating a special card is also not considered a move."

#: scenes/ui/game_ui.tscn
msgid "TUTORIAL_PAGE_10"
msgstr ""
"Manage the game by using the nails.\n"
"\n"
"The [color=a40000]Reset[/color] nail starts a new game.\n"
"Open the game menu with the [color=#ffe050]Pause[/color] nail.\n"
"If you ever want to get back to the tutorial, click the [color=#ffe050]Info[/"
"color] button.\n"
"\n"
"Hope you'll enjoy the game!"

